# Basic Bar Chart

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:plotly_ex, "~> 0.3"},
  {:kino, "~> 0.18"}
])
```

## Section

Create a bar chart with `Bar.new(x:, y:)`. The `x` list contains category
labels; `y` contains the bar heights.

```elixir
alias Plotly.{Figure, Bar}

Figure.new()
|> Figure.add_trace(
  Bar.new(
    x: ["giraffes", "orangutans", "monkeys"],
    y: [20, 14, 23]
  )
)
|> Plotly.show()
```
